{
  "label": "rindorm35",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label rindorm35:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Rin’s door and wait to hear if there’s a response.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She was doing a lot better the last time I saw her, so I’m hoping that things have all but healed by now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "One of the good things about Rin is that she makes it very apparent whenever she’s down.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I mean very apparent.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’ve seen her. You know what I’m talking about.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock again when there’s no response.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, are you in there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m bored.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Door’s open, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Having received Rin’s blessing, I prepare myself for whatever lies within her room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which version of her will I see today?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow1.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yo.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ah. I see I’ve stumbled upon the broken one once again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I feel like it’s lasted a little longer this time, but at least she hasn’t slipped into another state of delirium.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How are you feeling?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me? Oh, you know...Tired. Sad. Hungry. Bored.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well hopefully I can make at least one of those go away.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you bring food? I feel like the hunger issue would be the easiest to solve.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I regret to inform you that I do not have any food.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow2.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Damn. Back to the drawing board it is, then.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We could always go out to eat if you want.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What, you mean looking like this?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": News flash but I look like a cross between a zombie and a serial killer.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Serial killers aren’t normally this cute.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re not normally this hungry either. What with all the bodies they eat and stuff.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not all serial killers eat their victims, Rin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, but the best ones do.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow1.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What would you do with your victims if you were a serial killer, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What would I do?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. Like your signature. They’ve all got one.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...haven’t really thought about it before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I ever started killing people, I think my trademark would be something involving tongues.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m glad you’ve put so much thought into it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow3.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Think about it, though. The tongue has so many uses. It’s an underrated muscle.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need it to speak...to taste. Plus, you can use it sexually. There’s no other part of your body that can do all three of those things.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay, maybe Rin has slipped into delirium again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure you’re okay?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. But I haven’t hurt myself today, so at least there’s that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...that’s definitely a start.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow2.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...I’m getting there, though. I can feel it.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes, I’m even able to make it a full hour without thinking about her if I try hard enough.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is she still texting you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow4.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...I’ve been trying to keep my phone off as much as possible so I won’t have to deal with it, though.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you haven’t even thought about, you know, actually talking to her?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course I’ve thought about it. But despite how I may seem to you, I’m not really one of those go-getter types.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m actually a huge coward.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t like facing my problems when it’s easier to just lock myself in my room and wait for them to go away.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Downside is that those problems always have a way of catching up to you in the end. But it is what it is.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll just stay here all sad, hungry, tired, and bored or whatever.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Until you have to come out, that is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if rinbetrayed == False:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow5.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, speaking of which.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve been thinking a little more about that...post-heartbreak trip and...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I think it might be best if I do...explore a little.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Are you coming onto me right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know you’re normally into girls but, if you really want to-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow6.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I meant like, physically explore.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, so purely sexual? Yeah, then-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like purely exploring.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to go somewhere with you. Futaba too, if she’s free.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s a part of the city that I haven’t been to in a while.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s a little closer to my old middle school than the [high_school], so there hasn’t been much reason for me to go over there as of late.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But hey, change of pace and blah blah blah.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re actually ready to start going out again?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow1.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably not. But I’ll do my best to make myself look normal again so I can survive in the outside world for a few hours.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, maybe I’ll find something out there that’ll help take my mind off of stuff a little better.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...a new guitar or something.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. I’ll come out with you. Any idea when you’d want to go?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Haruka’s been pretty flexible with my hours lately, so how about we meet up at the cafe over the weekend?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even when I’m not working, I tend to show up there to grab coffee.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow2.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though, I haven’t really had the motivation to do that lately...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. That’s fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It looks like Rin and I will be going out on an excursion the next time I show up at the cafe in the morning.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "From the sound of it, I think it might wind up taking all day.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I should probably clear up my schedule and be ready for that in the near future...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ rininvite = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow1.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...but I think I’ve figured out a way to do that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m going to...go out exploring soon.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Look for some things that might help me feel normal again.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe...try out new guitars or something.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should bring Futaba along. The two of you might have some fun if you spend the day out doing...whatever girls do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s the same thing as whatever guys do, just cuter.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then yeah, that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": By the way, what are you watching?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow2.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm? This? Just some music thingy. It helps calm me down.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Most of the music I listen to is super angry and depressing, so hearing stuff like this is a big change of pace.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s the point of listening to angry and depressing music anyway? I never understood that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow1.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s nice knowing that other people out there share the same level of misery as me.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you’re basically cheering yourself up by hearing about how other peoples’ problems are worse than yours?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kind of, yeah. But it’s a little more than that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s like...validation. Or something.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, I’m still a [teenage]girl. We’re the prime demographic for overreacting and blowing things out of proportion.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So I’m kind of designed to feel like this at times.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But then again, so is everybody. You know?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why listen to happy music when it’s probably just fake?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Real life is like, 90%% bullshit and 10%% actual good stuff. You know that, don’t you?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, it makes a lot more sense when you put it that way.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just having trouble understanding how sadness is somehow able to make sadness go away.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow7.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not really easy to explain...It just does.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But not all the time. Hence the chill lofi girl.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, whatever works for you, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ringlow8.webp",
      "alt": "ringlow8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pro-tip, though...The next time you come to my room to try and cheer me up, bring a box of doughnuts or a cheeseburger.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Those have pretty much the same effect on me as an angsty pop punk album, but with more flavor and less ex-girlfriends.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t fully understand, but I’ll definitely stop somewhere and get you a cheeseburger the next time I have to go into damage-control mode.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ringlow1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
