      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...I’ll try my best to move on for both of our sakes...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just don’t hate me if I can’t get over you, okay? It’s been...kind of a long time, so it’s sort of ingrained into me now.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course...take all the time you need.",
